WEBVTT

00:00:15.450 --> 00:00:17.350
Hi, this is Ahnenerbe.

00:00:17.350 --> 00:00:20.340
We don't do meat on rice here-

00:00:20.840 --> 00:00:22.100
You're not ordering in?

00:00:22.600 --> 00:00:23.920
Continuation of the carnival?

00:00:25.370 --> 00:00:28.000
That ridiculous festival hasn't ended yet?!

00:00:28.950 --> 00:00:31.510
It's an endless hell of madness.

00:00:33.010 --> 00:00:37.250
It appears we're trapped in the invisible hand of God.

00:00:37.980 --> 00:00:40.410
It's just like an ephemeral dream.

00:00:40.410 --> 00:00:44.680
Even if it's a nightmare, we should still submit ourselves to it and enjoy it.

00:00:44.680 --> 00:00:46.040
That's really it.

00:00:46.040 --> 00:00:47.870
To an enjoyable nightmare...

00:00:47.870 --> 00:00:49.150
To hell itself...

00:00:49.150 --> 00:00:50.390
Cheers.

00:00:51.820 --> 00:00:52.810
It's starting!

00:02:39.950 --> 00:02:42.350
The Holy Grail Grand Prix!

00:02:42.940 --> 00:02:45.110
In Fuyuki!

00:02:46.590 --> 00:02:48.370
It's finally here!

00:02:48.370 --> 00:02:49.720
The 5th Holy Grail War!

00:02:49.720 --> 00:02:53.940
We'll be bringing you this sonic-speed ground battle live from the Fuyuki City suburban special course.

00:02:53.940 --> 00:02:55.630
The explanations will be done by...

00:02:55.630 --> 00:02:58.040
...me, Kotomine Kirei. Hello.

00:02:58.040 --> 00:03:02.050
The commentary will be done by me, the Tiger of Fuyuki, Fujimura Taiga.

00:03:02.050 --> 00:03:02.820
Rawr.

00:03:03.070 --> 00:03:06.990
The competitors are waiting to start, so let's see how they're doing.

00:03:06.990 --> 00:03:09.080
Seriously, a race?

00:03:09.410 --> 00:03:13.120
Just what do they think a proud battle between knights is supposed to be?

00:03:13.120 --> 00:03:14.710
It's not so bad, Saber.

00:03:14.710 --> 00:03:18.180
Shouldn't we be glad that we don't need to kill each other?

00:03:18.180 --> 00:03:19.750
I suppose you're right...

00:03:19.750 --> 00:03:21.930
So what car should we use?

00:03:22.260 --> 00:03:24.970
Your machines will be fairly decided by drawing lots!

00:03:24.970 --> 00:03:26.130
This again?

00:03:26.130 --> 00:03:27.970
We'll now introduce the competitors.

00:03:27.970 --> 00:03:30.320
The Rin and Archer team picked...

00:03:30.320 --> 00:03:31.870
...Unit Get-Money!

00:03:32.710 --> 00:03:34.380
We'll do our best, fair and square!

00:03:34.380 --> 00:03:35.640
Please give us your support!

00:03:35.640 --> 00:03:37.680
We'll use any underhanded tricks we need to win.

00:03:37.680 --> 00:03:39.980
So do what we normally do, basically.

00:03:39.980 --> 00:03:43.270
And the Soichiro and Caster team picked...

00:03:43.270 --> 00:03:45.040
...Unit Honeymoon!

00:03:45.040 --> 00:03:46.100
Ooh, oh no!

00:03:46.100 --> 00:03:47.990
It's like we're newlyweds!

00:03:47.990 --> 00:03:49.880
We have Lancer next.

00:03:49.880 --> 00:03:51.580
His machine is the Gae-BolCar.

00:03:51.580 --> 00:03:52.830
I'm gonna come first for s-

00:03:52.830 --> 00:03:54.320
Moving on!

00:03:54.320 --> 00:03:55.930
The Shinji and Rider team picked...

00:03:56.330 --> 00:03:57.670
...a granny bike!

00:03:57.670 --> 00:03:59.620
Why did we have to get a bike?!

00:03:59.620 --> 00:04:00.620
Don't worry.

00:04:00.620 --> 00:04:02.590
My Riding skill is ranked A+.

00:04:02.590 --> 00:04:03.790
Let's go, Unit Pegasus!

00:04:03.790 --> 00:04:04.970
Don't give it a name!

00:04:04.970 --> 00:04:07.750
And the Shirou and Saber team picked...

00:04:07.750 --> 00:04:08.730
Wild animal?

00:04:09.160 --> 00:04:10.930
...Unit Lion!

00:04:10.930 --> 00:04:11.710
A toy?!

00:04:11.710 --> 00:04:12.850
Shirou.

00:04:14.250 --> 00:04:15.380
Gimme 100 yen.

00:04:15.380 --> 00:04:16.360
It needs money?

00:04:16.360 --> 00:04:18.980
And now, the Ilya and Berserker team!

00:04:18.980 --> 00:04:20.250
What's that?

00:04:20.650 --> 00:04:22.230
Oh, here.

00:04:25.860 --> 00:04:27.830
Berser-Car!

00:04:27.830 --> 00:04:29.700
Wait, I dare you to try that again!

00:04:32.120 --> 00:04:34.370
All right, all competitors are in position.

00:04:34.370 --> 00:04:37.630
Kotomine-san, I foresee a huge battle. What do you think?

00:04:37.630 --> 00:04:41.700
Both the Mage's Association and the
Holy Church are struggling financially.

00:04:41.700 --> 00:04:45.220
I can only hope that they will keep fatalities to a minimum.

00:04:45.220 --> 00:04:46.590
Okay, it's almost time!

00:04:46.590 --> 00:04:48.080
The 5th Holy Grail Grand Prix.

00:04:48.080 --> 00:04:50.570
Which Master and Servant will emerge victorious?

00:04:50.570 --> 00:04:52.890
The signal will change from red...

00:04:53.320 --> 00:04:54.430
...to green!

00:04:54.430 --> 00:04:55.850
And the competitors are off!

00:04:55.850 --> 00:04:58.860
Who just took the lead with such incredible speed?

00:04:59.110 --> 00:05:01.150
It's Lancer's Gae-BolCar!

00:05:01.150 --> 00:05:01.730
Sorry.

00:05:01.980 --> 00:05:03.190
I'm settling this right here!

00:05:03.190 --> 00:05:03.940
Damn him!

00:05:03.940 --> 00:05:06.370
My Gae-BolCar is awesome.

00:05:06.370 --> 00:05:07.700
The speed is just incredible!

00:05:07.950 --> 00:05:09.730
Hey, Archer. Did you know?

00:05:09.730 --> 00:05:11.520
Dragsters...

00:05:11.520 --> 00:05:12.740
...can't turn.

00:05:13.700 --> 00:05:14.930
Lancer died!

00:05:14.930 --> 00:05:16.580
You aren't human!

00:05:16.580 --> 00:05:18.720
What a huge accident this early in the race.

00:05:18.720 --> 00:05:20.080
Now we have to clean it up...

00:05:20.080 --> 00:05:21.900
And that was just the start of the race!

00:05:21.900 --> 00:05:23.840
At the lead we have...

00:05:23.840 --> 00:05:26.150
Unit Honeymoon and Unit Get-Money!

00:05:26.150 --> 00:05:28.260
Unit Lion is also close behind!

00:05:28.260 --> 00:05:32.510
That vehicle may be a classic car, but it seems rather powerful.

00:05:33.200 --> 00:05:34.610
I'll get them here!

00:05:34.610 --> 00:05:35.640
Huh?

00:05:36.780 --> 00:05:39.800
I've already reached the goal!

00:05:39.800 --> 00:05:40.750
I see.

00:05:40.750 --> 00:05:42.400
So they're the winners.

00:05:42.400 --> 00:05:46.360
That said, take care of the Grail business for me, Sasaki!

00:05:46.360 --> 00:05:47.110
Roger!

00:05:47.110 --> 00:05:48.570
What?!

00:05:50.890 --> 00:05:53.580
Feels good to breathe the outside air after so long!

00:05:53.580 --> 00:05:55.640
Is that... Assassin?

00:05:55.640 --> 00:05:58.460
He's all loony from being cooped up in that temple for so long.

00:05:59.420 --> 00:06:00.310
Saber!

00:06:00.310 --> 00:06:01.150
No good.

00:06:01.150 --> 00:06:03.610
It won't go any faster without extra money!

00:06:03.610 --> 00:06:04.970
My purse is already empty!

00:06:04.970 --> 00:06:05.840
Shirou!

00:06:05.840 --> 00:06:06.690
What an idiot.

00:06:09.220 --> 00:06:10.620
Whoops!

00:06:10.620 --> 00:06:12.600
Did I hit something?

00:06:15.810 --> 00:06:19.680
How did Assassin manage to leave Ryuudou Temple?

00:06:24.620 --> 00:06:27.530
He loaded the entire temple gate in the truck?!

00:06:27.530 --> 00:06:30.160
I would've been free if I'd just done this from the start!

00:06:30.160 --> 00:06:31.410
Right, bro?

00:06:33.410 --> 00:06:34.610
I know, right?

00:06:34.610 --> 00:06:35.680
Let's do this, bro!

00:06:35.680 --> 00:06:36.950
It didn't even say anything!

00:06:37.300 --> 00:06:38.650
Outta the way!

00:06:40.920 --> 00:06:45.630
Assassin's decorated truck, having
taken Caster's place, is now in the lead!

00:06:45.630 --> 00:06:46.780
An unbelievable turn of events!

00:06:46.780 --> 00:06:49.260
Isn't this why the Grail War is so thrilling, Kotomine-san?

00:06:49.260 --> 00:06:52.070
I do hope that they'll drive safely.

00:06:52.070 --> 00:06:52.680
Damn it!

00:06:52.680 --> 00:06:55.300
Why is that decorated truck so fast?!

00:06:56.600 --> 00:06:58.890
Her talisman's working!

00:06:58.890 --> 00:07:00.490
So it's because of Caster's talisman.

00:07:00.490 --> 00:07:02.460
That woman really has her bases covered.

00:07:02.460 --> 00:07:04.730
Nothing's left of Assassin's original form.

00:07:04.730 --> 00:07:06.410
Onward to the goal!

00:07:08.520 --> 00:07:11.060
Hey. If we win...

00:07:11.910 --> 00:07:13.450
...wanna live together?

00:07:15.230 --> 00:07:16.160
Yeah, right?

00:07:26.340 --> 00:07:28.370
Bro!

00:07:31.850 --> 00:07:34.750
That's way too sad, in more ways than one.

00:07:34.750 --> 00:07:36.120
Who did that?

00:07:36.120 --> 00:07:37.350
Where was that fired from?

00:07:38.180 --> 00:07:40.600
Do it, Berser-Car!

00:07:40.600 --> 00:07:41.500
Ilya!

00:07:41.500 --> 00:07:43.310
I was wondering why we haven't been seeing her.

00:07:43.650 --> 00:07:45.790
Did she really take a shortcut here?!

00:07:46.320 --> 00:07:49.190
Since we're slow, all we need to do is crush everyone else!

00:07:49.190 --> 00:07:52.410
Panzer IV! Fire!

00:07:58.160 --> 00:07:59.450
This is fun!

00:07:59.450 --> 00:08:04.250
Don't you dare muck around in <i>my</i> city, in <i>my</i> race, meat doll!

00:08:05.670 --> 00:08:06.830
Goldy!

00:08:06.830 --> 00:08:08.020
Where do you think you're driving?!

00:08:08.020 --> 00:08:11.550
I won't allow a single vehicle to drive ahead of me!

00:08:13.720 --> 00:08:16.000
Restrain them, Enkidu!

00:08:19.290 --> 00:08:20.050
Argh!

00:08:20.050 --> 00:08:22.570
Shoot him, Berser-Car!

00:08:24.280 --> 00:08:26.170
Hah, you blew yourself up!

00:08:26.170 --> 00:08:29.790
A fitting end for an ugly meat doll like you. How amusing!

00:08:30.500 --> 00:08:32.070
Why are you...?!

00:08:32.070 --> 00:08:33.530
A foolish question.

00:08:37.280 --> 00:08:39.810
Good. Very good!

00:08:40.180 --> 00:08:43.090
This race isn't that bad of an event at all.

00:08:43.090 --> 00:08:44.170
However...

00:08:44.580 --> 00:08:47.580
Why wasn't I invited, Kotomine?!

00:08:48.160 --> 00:08:50.960
Well, you don't follow the rules.

00:08:50.960 --> 00:08:52.380
So what?

00:08:52.380 --> 00:08:53.750
I <i>am</i> the rules.

00:08:53.750 --> 00:08:57.340
I must be the first out of all things in the universe!

00:08:57.340 --> 00:08:59.160
Archer, intercept him.

00:08:59.160 --> 00:08:59.890
Are you sure?

00:08:59.890 --> 00:09:03.490
We're finally at the top, so we can't let him ruin it all!

00:09:03.490 --> 00:09:04.390
Understood.

00:09:05.340 --> 00:09:07.650
You've had your own way too often, King of Heroes.

00:09:08.220 --> 00:09:09.360
I'll shoot you down!

00:09:10.060 --> 00:09:12.860
You underestimate my riding technique!

00:09:12.860 --> 00:09:14.140
What riding skill!

00:09:14.140 --> 00:09:17.100
What on Earth did you immerse yourself into in this age?!

00:09:20.090 --> 00:09:21.620
Everything!

00:09:22.270 --> 00:09:24.730
What a surprise! Gilgamesh has entered the race!

00:09:24.730 --> 00:09:26.470
Is this good or bad?!

00:09:26.470 --> 00:09:31.420
If he's an adult, it'd be nice if he could listen to what others say.

00:09:31.420 --> 00:09:32.980
But you're not even a competitor!

00:09:32.980 --> 00:09:34.300
This is our win!

00:09:34.300 --> 00:09:36.030
I'll get you on this curve!

00:09:37.310 --> 00:09:38.260
Victory is mine!

00:09:38.530 --> 00:09:40.260
No, I'll overtake you both.

00:09:42.400 --> 00:09:43.520
Isn't that a bicycle?!

00:09:43.520 --> 00:09:44.890
What incredible cadence!

00:09:44.890 --> 00:09:46.270
Damn that granny bike!

00:09:48.570 --> 00:09:50.770
My Riding skill is ranked A+.

00:09:50.770 --> 00:09:53.280
I can ride even granny bikes to speed!

00:09:55.570 --> 00:09:57.060
N-Not bad at all.

00:09:57.060 --> 00:09:58.610
Y-You deserve praise, Rider.

00:09:58.610 --> 00:10:00.240
You really are the best!

00:10:03.430 --> 00:10:04.980
Looks like I went too fast.

00:10:04.980 --> 00:10:07.960
Shinji... phone home.

00:10:07.960 --> 00:10:09.840
What... was that?

00:10:09.840 --> 00:10:10.720
Don't worry about it.

00:10:10.720 --> 00:10:12.250
It was just a racecourse fairy.

00:10:12.520 --> 00:10:14.740
Now, the race is in its final stages.

00:10:14.740 --> 00:10:17.590
I hope it can end without any more trouble.

00:10:17.590 --> 00:10:21.060
Who will be in the lead after this final corner?!

00:10:21.060 --> 00:10:21.940
Here they come!

00:10:21.940 --> 00:10:23.060
They're neck-and-neck!

00:10:23.060 --> 00:10:26.850
GilGil-Machine is slightly in the lead, with Unit Get-Money close behind!

00:10:26.850 --> 00:10:28.740
It's been fun, little girl.

00:10:28.740 --> 00:10:32.210
You did well, but you'll never be
anything more than a foolish little girl.

00:10:32.210 --> 00:10:33.190
What was that?!

00:10:33.190 --> 00:10:34.530
Don't let him get to you, Rin!

00:10:34.530 --> 00:10:36.440
What the hell?! You barged in at the middle...!

00:10:36.440 --> 00:10:38.470
Whatever, look in front of you, Rin!

00:10:39.520 --> 00:10:41.090
Th-That melody must be...

00:10:42.120 --> 00:10:43.780
It's Unit Lion!

00:10:43.780 --> 00:10:45.040
What?!

00:10:45.040 --> 00:10:46.780
Unit Lion.

00:10:46.780 --> 00:10:48.950
If you really are a lion as well...

00:10:48.950 --> 00:10:51.230
...then overtake them with everything you've got!

00:10:52.420 --> 00:10:53.280
Saber!

00:10:53.280 --> 00:10:55.300
Why? What's going on?!

00:10:59.300 --> 00:11:01.440
I had to cancel my term deposit.

00:11:01.440 --> 00:11:06.060
Saber, we'll only be having tea on rice every meal from now on!

00:11:09.180 --> 00:11:12.310
That's way too ridiculous, you goddamn brutes!

00:11:12.310 --> 00:11:13.920
And the goal is right ahead!

00:11:13.920 --> 00:11:15.320
Any one of them could win this!

00:11:15.320 --> 00:11:16.620
Unit Lion's fast!

00:11:16.620 --> 00:11:18.610
It's closing the gap bit by bit with furious momentum!

00:11:18.610 --> 00:11:21.090
They're lining up, they're lining up!
The three of them are neck-and-neck!

00:11:21.090 --> 00:11:22.950
Bastard piece of scrap metal!

00:11:22.950 --> 00:11:24.400
Go, Rin!

00:11:24.400 --> 00:11:25.450
Damn it!

00:11:29.580 --> 00:11:32.170
Bastard!

00:11:32.830 --> 00:11:34.790
Come on!

00:11:36.300 --> 00:11:38.050
Trace on!

00:11:46.130 --> 00:11:47.740
What a turnaround!

00:11:47.740 --> 00:11:48.940
What a battle!

00:11:48.940 --> 00:11:52.040
The winner is Unit Lion, team Shirou and Saber!

00:11:52.040 --> 00:11:54.690
Good thing it ended without an accident.

00:11:58.400 --> 00:11:59.400
Shirou.

00:11:59.400 --> 00:12:00.690
That's...

00:12:01.350 --> 00:12:02.700
...the Holy Grail!

00:12:02.700 --> 00:12:05.330
The Holy Grail has finally appeared.

00:12:05.330 --> 00:12:08.830
The dreams of you both can now be granted.

00:12:17.220 --> 00:12:18.420
Please give us...

00:12:18.420 --> 00:12:19.810
...our money back.

00:12:23.530 --> 00:12:25.990
Grail-kun!

00:12:27.480 --> 00:12:29.290
Grail-kun!

00:12:29.290 --> 00:12:30.710
What's wrong, Shinji-kun?

00:12:30.710 --> 00:12:33.040
Gil won't listen to me!

00:12:33.040 --> 00:12:35.260
And I'm supposed to be his Master!

00:12:36.110 --> 00:12:39.230
You're so hopeless, Shinji-kun.

00:12:40.200 --> 00:12:42.920
Friendmaker!

00:12:45.450 --> 00:12:47.370
Go show him who's boss.

00:14:20.080 --> 00:14:22.300
This is the real thing.

00:14:22.300 --> 00:14:24.590
Next episode preview!

00:14:24.590 --> 00:14:27.280
Thank you very much, thank you very much!

00:14:27.280 --> 00:14:31.700
The 3rd season of everyone's Taiga Dojo has finally returned!

00:14:31.700 --> 00:14:35.270
Appearing in each episode this season will be me, Fujimura Taiga, and...

00:14:35.270 --> 00:14:37.570
...me, Student No. 1!

00:14:37.570 --> 00:14:39.930
The cheerful and fun anime, Carnival Phantasm.

00:14:39.930 --> 00:14:43.660
The clean, funny, and gentle anime, Carnival Phantasm.

00:14:43.660 --> 00:14:46.110
Next episode: Brainwash Detective Loli Reversion.

00:14:46.110 --> 00:14:47.790
Please support us!

00:14:47.790 --> 00:14:51.160
Thank you very much, thank you very much!
